{
  "label": "Draft deliverables",
  "description": "Write the product deliverables and their docs (feature.md §1 step 3). ONE TURN in this phase's conversation: the prompt arrives already rendered, from whichever transition sent control here, so this state declares no per-arrival slots. What it still owns is the OUTPUT CONTRACT — the shape every arrival is held to — and the session that makes the conversation the accumulator rather than the template.",
